From: thanhan92-f1 <thanhan92-f1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HiTechPay white-label: HiTechPay for WooCommerce

- Plugin header, admin labels, order notes and customer messages rebranded to
  HiTechPay; text domain hitechpay-woocommerce with Domain Path /languages and
  load_plugin_textdomain().
- Default endpoints: https://api.hitechpay.vn (production),
  https://sandbox-api.hitechpay.vn (sandbox), checkout SDK
  https://checkout.hitechpay.vn/HyperLoader.js; overridable via wp-config
  constants or the new "Custom API URL" / "Custom Checkout SDK URL" settings.
  The SDK is initialised with customBackendUrl so it uses the same host.
- Checkout language setting (default vi) passed to hyper.widgets({ locale }).
- Currency fallback VND; minor-unit conversion follows Hyperswitch's
  zero-/three-decimal currency table (VND was previously multiplied by 100).
- Webhook signature compared with hash_equals; refund and manual capture
  requests are blocking so their status can be read; SDK logs go to the
  configured HiTechPay API host only; wc_get_page_id instead of the removed
  woocommerce_get_page_id.
- HiTechPay icon/logo (assets/images, icon.png), badges for viet_qr, momo,
  momo_atm, local_bank_redirect; removed Hyperswitch banners/screenshots.
- Vietnamese translation languages/hitechpay-woocommerce-vi.po (.mo not
  compiled: msgfmt unavailable in the build environment).

Gateway id, option keys, AJAX/webhook action names and PHP class/function
names are unchanged so existing installs keep their settings.

